Se folosesc în combinație cu alte implanturi ROOTT<br> </h6>\n            <p class=\"implant_details_center__wrap__p\">\n                            </p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section><div class=\"s-li\">\n    \t\t<div id=\"bx_1373509569_511\" class=\"frame-1336\">\n\t\t<div class=\"frame-1548\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"frame-1497\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"/images/roott/upload/iblock/a9d/0ewpxg22xjseujuntgprwy7wfd8lmc3u.png\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"195\" height=\"310\" alt=\"\" class=\"roott-b-1\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"/images/roott/upload/iblock/b03/g3qq3jpys78hm4x5269njszpbc7por5s.png\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"157\" height=\"32\" alt=\"\" class=\"roott-r-17\">\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"frame-1337\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"frame-1338\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"basal\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"basal basal\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"basal-0\">Implantul BASAL</span><span class=\"basal-1\"> </span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"text-22\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tImplantul monobloc BASAL, cu suprafață lustruită, este indicat în atrofia osoasă severă. Se inserează în stratul bazal dens al osului. Suprafața sa netedă și colul alungit nu permit înmulțirea microbilor.\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"{{L}}/catalog/roott-b\" class=\"btn-more-b w-inline-block\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div>Detalii</div>\n\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n    \t\t<div id=\"bx_1373509569_1182\" class=\"frame-1336\">\n\t\t<div class=\"frame-1548\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"frame-1497\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"/images/roott/upload/iblock/b89/l2g3tor2x5q3vrns3omnyahpa3313umw.png\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"195\" height=\"310\" alt=\"\" class=\"roott-b-1\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"/images/roott/upload/iblock/c47/l25ctqo6of3ttz21bqzswr5geus9bnha.png\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"157\" height=\"32\" alt=\"\" class=\"roott-r-17\">\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"frame-1337\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"frame-1338\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"basal\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"basal basal\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"basal-0\">ROOTFORM</span><span class=\"basal-1\"> </span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"text-22\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tROOTFORM — implanturi pentru implantarea clasică. Doar în prezența unui volum suficient de țesut. Inserarea se face prin decolarea gingiei, urmată de suturare.\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"{{L}}/catalog/roott-r\" class=\"btn-more-b w-inline-block\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div>Detalii</div>\n\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n    \t\t<div id=\"bx_1373509569_1191\" class=\"frame-1336\">\n\t\t<div class=\"frame-1548\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"frame-1497\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"/images/roott/upload/iblock/9ea/2ri2f8us783yzppfbudqcyf8v88x1go0.png\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"195\" height=\"310\" alt=\"\" class=\"roott-b-1\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"/images/roott/upload/iblock/4a1/xb2ef0thjny09oguu3w1he2vid67iskj.png\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"157\" height=\"32\" alt=\"\" class=\"roott-r-17\">\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"frame-1337\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"frame-1338\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"basal\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"basal basal\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"basal-0\">COMPRESSIVE</span><span class=\"basal-1\"> </span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"text-22\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tCOMPRESSIVE, cu filet compresiv special, se deosebește de COMPRESSIVE S prin colul lung și bontul îndoibil.\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"{{L}}/catalog/roott-c\" class=\"btn-more-b w-inline-block\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div>Detalii</div>\n\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n    \t\t<div id=\"bx_1373509569_1192\" class=\"frame-1336\">\n\t\t<div class=\"frame-1548\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"frame-1497\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"/images/roott/upload/iblock/44f/inq547xnmy2ws3g6znqjj9erhtxispvf.png\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"195\" height=\"310\" alt=\"\" class=\"roott-b-1\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"/images/roott/upload/iblock/256/tl7v8u6ofud5w63e2lw55cyxlc6qv2ni.png\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"157\" height=\"32\" alt=\"\" class=\"roott-r-17\">\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"frame-1337\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"frame-1338\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"basal\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"basal basal\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"basal-0\">COMPRESSIVE MP</span><span class=\"basal-1\"> </span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"text-22\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tMulti-unit-urile COMPRESSIVE MP, cu unghi de înclinare de până la 30°, se inserează în edentația totală sau parțială. Fixarea înșurubată a protezelor face ușoară îndepărtarea și montarea lucrărilor.\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"{{L}}/catalog/roott-p\" class=\"btn-more-b w-inline-block\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div>Detalii</div>\n\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n    </div><section class=\"s-wl\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"frame-1335\">\n            <div class=\"text-21\">\nStomatologii folosesc aproape toate tipurile de implanturi bazale, astfel încât sarcina asupra lor după fixarea lucrărilor protetice să fie uniformă. Acest lucru le permite să funcționeze o perioadă îndelungată.<br>            </div>\n            <a href=\"/files/roott/upload/uf/31d/do7pk0v9ce3d46grbl7u7jj4pvmvmf7c.pdf\" class=\"btn-main-g w-button\">Descarcă PDF</a>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section><div id=\"napisite-nam\" class=\"s-call\">\n\t<div class=\"div-block-13\">\n\t\t<div class=\"div-block-14\">\n\t\t\t<img src=\"/images/roott/tpl/assets/img/ewfwef3241efw.png\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"ROOTT\" class=\"image-7\">\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"div-block-15\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"div-block-16\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"feedback__green\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<form class=\"feedback__green__form\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"feedback__green__txt1\">Aveți întrebări?</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"feedback__green__txt2\">Scrieți-ne</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<select name=\"select\" class=\"form-s